────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TRAINING DATA
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Primary source of legal text:
  Mevzuat.gov.tr / bedesten.adalet.gov.tr — Republic of Türkiye legislation,
  public government sources.

Hugging Face datasets used (both Apache License 2.0):
  OrionCAF/turkish_law_qa_dataset
  Renicames/turkish-law-chatbot

Synthetic pairs were generated FROM the statute text above and verified.

⚠️ NO commercial legal databases (Lexpera, Kazancı, etc.) were used at any
point. This was a standing project rule from the beginning, not a later
cleanup — see docs/VERI_PLANI.md.

